{"verse_key": "10:35", "surah": 10, "verse": 35, "text_uthmani": "قُلْ هَلْ مِن شُرَكَآئِكُم مَّن يَهْدِىٓ إِلَى ٱلْحَقِّ ۚ قُلِ ٱللَّهُ يَهْدِى لِلْحَقِّ ۗ أَفَمَن يَهْدِىٓ إِلَى ٱلْحَقِّ أَحَقُّ أَن يُتَّبَعَ أَمَّن لَّا يَهِدِّىٓ إِلَّآ أَن يُهْدَىٰ ۖ فَمَا لَكُمْ كَيْفَ تَحْكُمُونَ", "translation": "Say, \"Are there of your 'partners' any who guides to the truth?\" Say, \"Allāh guides to the truth. So is He who guides to the truth more worthy to be followed or he who guides not unless he is guided? Then what is [wrong] with you - how do you judge?\"", "verse_from_ms": 883910, "verse_to_ms": 919330, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 883910, "end_ms": 884630}, {"i": 1, "text": "هَلْ", "start_ms": 884630, "end_ms": 885010}, {"i": 2, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 885010, "end_ms": 885760}, {"i": 3, "text": "شُرَكَآئِكُم", "start_ms": 885760, "end_ms": 888540}, {"i": 4, "text": "مَّن", "start_ms": 888540, "end_ms": 890030}, {"i": 5, "text": "يَهْدِىٓ", "start_ms": 890030, "end_ms": 892350}, {"i": 6, "text": "إِلَى", "start_ms": 892350, "end_ms": 892690}, {"i": 7, "text": "ٱلْحَقِّ", "start_ms": 892690, "end_ms": 894670}, {"i": 8, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 894670, "end_ms": 894990}, {"i": 9, "text": "قُلِ", "start_ms": 894990, "end_ms": 895860}, {"i": 10, "text": "ٱللَّهُ", "start_ms": 895860, "end_ms": 896620}, {"i": 11, "text": "يَهْدِى", "start_ms": 896620, "end_ms": 898610}, {"i": 12, "text": "لِلْحَقِّ", "start_ms": 898610, "end_ms": 899840}, {"i": 13, "text": "ۗ", "start_ms": 899840, "end_ms": 901950}, {"i": 14, "text": "أَفَمَن", "start_ms": 901950, "end_ms": 902340}, {"i": 15, "text": "يَهْدِىٓ", "start_ms": 902340, "end_ms": 903110}, {"i": 16, "text": "إِلَى", "start_ms": 903110, "end_ms": 903850}, {"i": 17, "text": "ٱلْحَقِّ", "start_ms": 903850, "end_ms": 904750}, {"i": 18, "text": "أَحَقُّ", "start_ms": 904750, "end_ms": 905720}, {"i": 19, "text": "أَن", "star